{"id":"vod_md_2449","vodId":"2449","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"散华礼弥","name_cn":"散华礼弥","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"14集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230814-1/52bbad7457fc9801c7b5535538204b03.jpg"},"summary":"散华礼弥（内田真礼 配音）本该是一个快乐活泼的女孩，可是与亡母过分想象的外貌激发了父亲散华团一郎（石冢运升 配音）超限度的溺爱和束缚，这让礼弥感到痛苦万分，甚至因此而失足从悬崖上摔落而死。没想到，礼弥的死却促成了她和偶然间邂逅的少年降谷千紘（木村良平 配音）之间的一段缘分。为了使爱猫复活，对僵尸极其狂热的降谷研发了一种怪异的药剂，他将这种药剂用在了已死的礼弥身上，没想到，礼弥居然以僵尸的形式重生了。就这样，僵尸礼弥顺其自然的成为了降谷家的寄宿者，而为了使礼弥能够重新成为普通的女孩，降谷开始为了研究新的药剂而开始了奔波。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-14 08:57:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/3dqVsNfe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/xpBWkVHV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/h9EpDHXl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/GpJhuNlm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/jDX8jqH6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/Ehvwj153/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/Bf7eHi4V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/iarqxAGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/DM8yPZvS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/rS0plvBM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/tJTW6pPK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/GPN2Of81/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/6onWKyrw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/H8cT8ACB/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:58.450Z"}